<title>UK: Merrill lynch sets 150 bln lire three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Merrill lynch sets 150 bln lire three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead manager Merrill Lynch and BCI Milan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH &amp; CO</p>
<p> AMT    150 BLN LIRE  COUPON    *7.0	 MATURITY    12.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.15    PAY DATE    12.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    100.00    SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES     *ISSUER HAS RIGHT TO EXCHANGE BOND AT EACH COUPON</p>
<p>DATE</p>
<p>		TO EXCHANGE INTO AN FRN AT ITALIAN LIBOR +20 BP.</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA-   DENOMS (M) 5-50	LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> MGT/UND    22.5 BP   SELL CONC  1.15	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
